post.summary:
Uninstall Knative from the cluster (async job).
The region Traefik stays while it serves non-Knative Ingresses (e.g. the RunR console);
`remove_traefik: true` removes it anyway

get.summary:
GET /projects/{project}/workflow-runs and GET /projects/{project}/workflows/{workflow}/runs
Filters: status (comma separated), workflow (name), source, q (run id / event name),
from, to (ISO dates), per_page (≤ 100)

